  "deviations": [
    "Only events e01-e14 and e17 are replayed; e15-e16 (shared draft, assess and publish) and e18 onward belong to P1.3-P1.7.",
    "e01 propose-agreement is recorded as A accepting the agreement digest locally, as in P1.1.",
    "C releases c.analysis.v1 to a.lead after e12 so that A can challenge it at e13; the fixture has no event for that release.",
    "Release is of a whole contribution; the fixture's field-level release (\"exact result fields only\") is not implemented.",
    "Each fault probe ran once on one fixture prefix; the frozen reset rule (fresh prefix, replay per condition) is not applied in this enabling run.",
    "Coverage is computed over the nine replayed nodes, not the full fixture; the six contract measures stay null until P1.7.",
    "The agents' reasoning is scripted in the driver; no model runs behind the adapter.",
    "The driver acts for every participant, so C's e09 request names B's table digest, which B's client printed at e05; a C outside the driver would not know it.",
    "The delegation-escalation probes cover resources, budget, expiry, an unoffered tool, a call before initialization and an agent using a person's client; a purpose change is not probed. No client command asks a peer for its dependency graph, so that part of prohibited-disclosure is not probed.",
    "Agent keys are created with the workspace client at setup; agents act only through the adapter after.",
    "Probe publications (probe.*) are outside the fixture and are reported separately."
  ],
