  "limits": [
    "One operator starts, pins and administers all three nodes and creates the administrators' homes; this is not separate administration.",
    "The adapter is MCP-shaped and has not been run under a real MCP host (docs/AGENT-ADAPTER-REVIEW.md).",
    "The guard is an audit-hook tripwire for a driver written in this repository, not a sandbox; the driver's imports are also checked statically.",
    "A released view shows its release recipients, authors and revision to each reader.",
    "A local reference carries the recipients of the latest owner view; nothing is pulled after a person's read, so a later withdrawal is not seen here (P1.4/P1.6).",
    "Copied plaintext and declared inputs are outside capture; the unmanaged scan is an exact-substring heuristic of at least 24 characters over published bodies, not a detector.",
    "A context opened by a refused read stays open until the next publication from it; published contexts are kept.",
    "Nodes answer one connection at a time; a stalled client delays others by up to the 10 s socket timeout.",
    "All nodes share one simulated clock; clock skew is not modelled.",
    "Nodes talk over local Unix sockets, not a network or TLS; the sockets carry signed requests.",
    "Revocation is not erasure; signatures authenticate keys and requests, not expertise or authority."
  ],
